: 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "W[spiral, feature 1] = -0.234997  (initial random parameter)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "W[spiral, feature 1] = -0.234997  (initial random parameter)"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-186", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2315, "width": 1880, "height": 55, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840186, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830186, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b30", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "ONE PARTIAL TERM, not the final logit:\na[1] 0.279412 x initial classifier weight W[spiral,1] -0.234997 = -0.065661. This product is one number added into the spiral score.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ONE PARTIAL TERM, not the final logit:\na[1] 0.279412 x initial classifier weight W[spiral,1] -0.234997 = -0.065661. This product is one number added into the spiral score.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "ONE PARTIAL TERM, not the final logit:\na[1] 0.279412 x initial classifier weight W[spiral,1] -0.234997 = -0.065661. This product is one number added into the spiral score."}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-187", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2385, "width": 1880, "height": 55, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840187, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b31", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "COMPLETE spiral logit = -0.005528 - 0.065661 - 0.023923 + 0.007959 + bias 0.197863 = about 0.110709.\nOnly this complete logit enters softmax with the other 3 logits -> P(spiral) = 0.294907.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "COMPLETE spiral logit = -0.005528 - 0.065661 - 0.023923 + 0.007959 + bias 0.197863 = about 0.110709.\nOnly this complete logit enters softmax with the other 3 logits -> P(spiral) = 0.294907.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "COMPLETE spiral logit = -0.005528 - 0.065661 - 0.023923 + 0.007959 + bias 0.197863 = about 0.110709.\nOnly this complete logit enters softmax with the other 3 logits -> P(spiral) = 0.294907."}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-188", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2470, "width": 1050, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840188, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830188, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b32", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: four features times one class row, plus bias", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: four features times one class row, plus bias", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: four features times one class row, plus bias"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-189", "type": "text", "x": 1150, "y": 2470, "width": 790, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840189, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b33", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: why this weight matrix is 4x4", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: why this weight matrix is 4x4", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: why this weight matrix is 4x4"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-190", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2530, "width": 1880, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840190, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830190, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b34", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "3. Forward USES weights. Backward finds gradients. SGD CHANGES weights.", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3. Forward USES weights. Backward finds gradients. SGD CHANGES weights.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "3. Forward USES weights. Backward finds gradients. SGD CHANGES weights."}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-191", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2590, "width": 1880, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840191, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830191, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b35", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "new_weight = old_weight - learning_rate * gradient", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "new_weight = old_weight - learning_rate * gradient", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "new_weight = old_weight - learning_rate * gradient"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-192", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2640, "width": 1880, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840192, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830192, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b36", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Equivalently: ADD the change (-learning_rate * gradient), not the gradient itself. Here learning_rate = 0.1.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Equivalently: ADD the change (-learning_rate * gradient), not the gradient itself. Here learning_rate = 0.1.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Equivalently: ADD the change (-learning_rate * gradient), not the gradient itself. Here learning_rate = 0.1."}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-193", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2700, "width": 1880, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840193, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830193, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b37", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Convolution red-center: -0.102860 - 0.1*(+0.014876) = -0.104348  (decreases)", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Convolution red-center: -0.102860 - 0.1*(+0.014876) = -0.104348  (decreases)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Convolution red-center: -0.102860 - 0.1*(+0.014876) = -0.104348  (decreases)"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-194", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2750, "width": 1880, "height": 28.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840194, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830194, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b38", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Classifier W[1,1]:      -0.234997 - 0.1*(-0.061518) = -0.228845  (increases)", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Classifier W[1,1]:      -0.234997 - 0.1*(-0.061518) = -0.228845  (increases)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Classifier W[1,1]:      -0.234997 - 0.1*(-0.061518) = -0.228845  (increases)"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-195", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2810, "width": 1880, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840195, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830195, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b39", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Next pass: SAME RGB inputs -> updated filters -> new features -> updated classifier -> new logits. No stored pixels change.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Next pass: SAME RGB inputs -> updated filters -> new features -> updated classifier -> new logits. No stored pixels change.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Next pass: SAME RGB inputs -> updated filters -> new features -> updated classifier -> new logits. No stored pixels change."}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-196", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2870, "width": 990, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840196, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b3A", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: different gradients, same SGD rule", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: different gradients, same SGD rule", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: different gradients, same SGD rule"}, {"id": "rgb-neurons-197", "type": "text", "x": 1130, "y": 2870, "width": 800, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 840197, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 830197, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b3B", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: why gradients belong to connections", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: why gradients belong to connections", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Concept: why gradients belong to connections"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}